=2 Walkthrough
* After speaking with {n:Hieronymus}, go to any Bastok controlled area and talk to the {p:Campaign Arbiter}.
* Give the correct {p:Crystal} orders corresponding to the NPC's present at a given time.
** You do not need to bring any crystals. NPCs will appear on-screen, just choose their corresponding crystal from the list that appears.
* Talk to the {p:Campaign Arbiter} to teleport back to {z:Bastok Markets (S)}.
* Report back to {n:Hieronymus} to complete the mission.

=2 Notes
